// The return hub: the gate every shallow flow lands on, and the floor a deep
// flow's sub-hub hands back to. One line and one chip set, identical on every
// return and never a second greeting (CONTEXT.md "Hub"). Extracted from
// core.yarn so the return gates read as one concern; the products sub-hub
// (products.yarn) is the first of them.
//
// The provenance markers (OBSERVED / ADAPTED / AUTHORED), the `// src:` rule,
// and the authoring rules for the whole tree are at the top of core.yarn.

title: hub
position: 212,464
---
// The return gate. The shallow flows (general, support, demo, privacy) land
// here, and it is the same five chips every time it is reached — no first-return
// variant. `#newmessage` keeps the follow-up question out of the beat's bubble.
Cam: Is there anything else I can help you with today? #newmessage
-> Products & offerings
  <<jump products>>
-> Get a Demo
  <<set $demoRequested = true>>
  <<jump demo>>
-> Privacy & safety
  <<jump privacy>>
-> Support
  <<jump support>>
-> That's all for now ~ talk soon
  <<jump end>>
===
